# astrion-skill v1
goal: Lower system volume one step
trigger:
  - phrase: "quieter"
  - phrase: "volume down"
  - phrase: "turn down the volume"
do: |
  Lower the system output volume by 10% via the system.setVolume
  capability. Floor at 0%. Briefly show the new level in a notification
  toast with a volume icon.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 100
  reversibility: FREE
